message: "If you use this code or dataset, please cite the paper and the Zenodo dataset (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23523441)."
title: "OS Noise for Agentic AI: A Kernel-Trace Study of How Container Resource Limits Slow Down and Break AI Coding Agents"
abstract: >-
  Code and metadata artifact for a kernel-trace (LTTng) study of how container
  resource limits (CPU, cores, memory, disk I/O) affect the latency and
  reliability of AI coding agents (Claude Code and Codex CLI). Four mechanism
  studies plus an end-to-end test, with cgroup counters as ground truth.
